# Watery Grasp, "Enchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step." Bot1 attacks with its Memnite and Ornithopter on turn 3 (both tap) and, after
# combat, enchants the Memnite with the Grasp: at its turn 5 untap step the Ornithopter untaps and the Memnite does not.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Memnite
Ornithopter
Watery Grasp
Island
Island
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x22

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Memnite; Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Watery Grasp.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Tapped = false
